OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly cloudy start today,
OL,6,Fbecoming increasingly murky and mild
OL,7,Fas patchy rain arrives in the
OL,8,Fsouthwest during the afternoon. Most
OL,9,Feastern areas will remain dry.
OL,10,FBecoming breezy, with strong winds
OL,11,Falong coasts and hills later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA murky night with some heavy
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, and fog for hills
OL,15,Fand along exposed coasts. Breezy, with
OL,16,Fstrong winds along southern coasts.
OL,17,FFeeling much milder than Saturday
OL,18,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
