OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FMurky with areas of fog, and
OL,6,Fpatchy rain which may be heavy in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Becoming breezy, with some
OL,8,Fstrong winds for coasts and hills
OL,9,Flater, but feeling very mild.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,12,Fand strong winds will pass on Tuesday
OL,13,Fmorning to become brighter and cooler.
OL,14,FBreezy during Wednesday but dry and
OL,15,Fbright, then increasingly cloudy,
OL,16,Fshowery and windy through Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
